{
    "title": "Lark Video Player: HD Video",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf1f A light & powerful offline video player, with full HD video & major formats supported. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\ud83c\udf1f You can play offline video in a video pop-up, also to play video as MP3.\r\n\ud83c\udf1f It loads video subtitles, and also work as a powerful media file manager.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nKey features:\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\ud83d\udcbf HD, ultra HD video\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\tHD video, Full HD video, Ultra HD video all run smoothly, experience the ultimate in offline video playback with Lark Video Player. \t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\ud83c\udfa5 All formats\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\tIt's compatible with major formats, including mkv, mp4, m4v, mov, 3gp, 3gp2, mpg2, ts, webm etc. \t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\ud83d\udcf2 Video popup\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\tTired of interruptions while watching videos? Lark Video Player covers video popup feature. Enjoy stable floating video playback  even while multitasking or using other apps on your device.\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12Keep videos in the private folder        \r\n        Hide your videos in a private folder to protect your privacy, set password for the private folder.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Play offline video as MP3\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\tWhen you're occupied, you can listen to the video by playing video as audio in the background. \t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\ud83d\udcc1 Manage media files\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\tOrganizing video files has never been easier. The HD video player allows you to search, manage your video files & other media files effortlessly, with auto sorting by folders and by categories. \t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\ud83d\udc46\ud83c\udffb Gestures & one click to control \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\tAdjust progress, brightness, video volume, speed, auto-rotate, items to be played, etc with gestures or one click.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Light & stylish video player\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\tPlay your videos with this lightweight and stylish offline video player, takes less space in your device.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 offline player for HQ music\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\tManage and listen to offline music files, with cool sound effect. The offline player make it one-stop for music & video play when there is no network. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nIt's a feature-packed, high-quality offline video player for Android. Start to play video, experience the smooth & clean HD video playback with this offline video player now. \r\nIf any suggestions please contact with Lark Video Player dev team in 'Setting' - 'Feedback'.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf1f A light &amp; powerful offline video player, with full HD video &amp; major formats supported. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\ud83c\udf1f You can play offline video in a video pop-up, also to play video as MP3.<br>\ud83c\udf1f It loads video subtitles, and also work as a powerful media file manager.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>Key features:\t<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\ud83d\udcbf HD, ultra HD video\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\tHD video, Full HD video, Ultra HD video all run smoothly, experience the ultimate in offline video playback with Lark Video Player. \t<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\ud83c\udfa5 All formats\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\tIt&#39;s compatible with major formats, including mkv, mp4, m4v, mov, 3gp, 3gp2, mpg2, ts, webm etc. \t\t<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\ud83d\udcf2 Video popup\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\tTired of interruptions while watching videos? Lark Video Player covers video popup feature. Enjoy stable floating video playback  even while multitasking or using other apps on your device.\t\t\t<br><br>\ud83d\udd12Keep videos in the private folder        <br>        Hide your videos in a private folder to protect your privacy, set password for the private folder.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\ud83c\udfa7 Play offline video as MP3\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\tWhen you&#39;re occupied, you can listen to the video by playing video as audio in the background. \t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t\t<br>\ud83d\udcc1 Manage media files\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\tOrganizing video files has never been easier. The HD video player allows you to search, manage your video files &amp; other media files effortlessly, with auto sorting by folders and by categories. \t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\ud83d\udc46\ud83c\udffb Gestures &amp; one click to control \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\tAdjust progress, brightness, video volume, speed, auto-rotate, items to be played, etc with gestures or one click.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Light &amp; stylish video player\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\tPlay your videos with this lightweight and stylish offline video player, takes less space in your device.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\ud83c\udfb5 offline player for HQ music\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\tManage and listen to offline music files, with cool sound effect. The offline player make it one-stop for music &amp; video play when there is no network. <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>It&#39;s a feature-packed, high-quality offline video player for Android. Start to play video, experience the smooth &amp; clean HD video playback with this offline video player now. <br>If any suggestions please contact with Lark Video Player dev team in &#39;Setting&#39; - &#39;Feedback&#39;.",
